---
// Author hover cards, queried from each co-author's own Linked Data with Comunica.
//
// The script below is the only client-side JavaScript the site ships, and Astro inlines it
// because it is small. It goes on every page rather than only the ones with a bibliography:
// it looks for `a.author[resource]` and returns immediately when there is none, which is
// cheaper than deciding per layout which pages carry authors.
//
// Comunica itself is not here. `foaf-tooltip.ts` reaches it through `new Worker(...)`, so
// Vite emits it as a separate chunk that is only fetched once a reader hovers a name.
---
<script>
  import '../scripts/foaf-tooltip.ts'
</script>
